  "title": "Lower-Carb Eggplant Pizza",
  "description": "By topping slices of eggplant with sauce, cheese, and your favorite pizza toppings, you&#39;ll end up with a lower-carb pizza than if you&#39;d used a regular pizza crust.",
  "authors": [
